dlg 1
node start
  say Anna Morning. You must be the one who took the old plot.
  choice Ask about farming -> farming
  choice Ask about the town -> town
  choice Say goodbye -> bye
node farming
  say Anna Till it, plant it, water it. Water it every day or it just sits there.
  say Anna Parsnips take four days. Turnips are quicker if you want coins today.
  goto bye
node town
  say Anna Not much of one yet. The shop opens at nine, if I remember to open it.
  goto bye
node bye
  say Anna Go on then. Daylight is the part you cannot buy back.
  end
